      "id": 1000974,
      "name": "[Affinity] The Girl's Parasol",
      "desc": "Vivian has evoked the Mindscape Cinema: <color=#FFAF2C>[\"Walking Into the Orchard in Spring\"]</color>.\n[\"Walking Into the Orchard in Spring\"]: When a total of 4 <color=#FFFFFF>Guard Feathers</color> are consumed, gain 1 <color=#FFFFFF>Flight Feather</color>. All Attribute Anomaly DMG and <color=#FFFFFF>Disorder</color> DMG received by targets under <color=#FFFFFF>Vivian's Prophecy</color> increases by 16%.",
      "desc2": "The hem of her dress and the parasol are more than just a girl's way of attracting attention. When Vivian opens her parasol, her fierce protective instinct sweeps any obstacles, shielding her from all hostility.",
